      "synopsis": "Detective Folder is a 2D puzzle-platformer built in Unity by a 5-person student team, in which you play a detective for the clandestine Anomalous Crimes Unit — folding a living comic-book world to reshape platforms, uncover clues, and track down the \"Baahd Guys.\"",
